---
import LossCurve from "./LossCurve.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
---

<section
  id="top"
  class="relative isolate overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-40 md:pb-28"
>
  <!-- Background atmosphere -->
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid"></div>
    <div
      class="glow-blob left-[-20%] top-[-10%] h-[42rem] w-[42rem] bg-gradient-to-tr from-accent-500/35 via-signal-violet/20 to-transparent"
    ></div>
    <div
      class="glow-blob right-[-15%] top-[10%] h-[36rem] w-[36rem] bg-gradient-to-bl from-signal-cyan/30 via-accent-500/15 to-transparent"
    ></div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-line-strong to-transparent"
    ></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="reveal flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="badge">
        <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse-soft rounded-full bg-signal-green"></span>
        v0.1.0 · Reproducing Zozoulenko et al. (2026)
      </span>
      <span class="hidden badge sm:inline-flex">
        <span class="chip-dot"></span>
        Pure NumPy · No runtime deps
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-8 max-w-[58rem]" style="animation-delay: 60ms;">
      <h1
        class="text-display-2xl font-display text-balance text-ink"
      >
        Second-order boosting,
        <span class="text-gradient-brand">regularized to convergence.</span>
      </h1>
    </div>

    <p
      class="reveal mt-7 max-w-[44rem] text-pretty text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted md:text-[1.1875rem]"
      style="animation-delay: 120ms;"
    >
      A faithful, dependency-free reproduction of
      <em>Gradient Regularized Newton Boosting Trees</em> &mdash; the algorithm
      that turns Newton's second-order signal into a globally convergent
      boosting iteration. Vanilla Newton diverges. GRN converges.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3" style="animation-delay: 180ms;">
      <a href={withBase("#install")} class="btn btn-gradient">
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3" />
        </svg>
        pip install grnbt
      </a>
      <a href="#overview" class="btn btn-ghost">
        Read overview
        <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/sachncs/gradient-regularized-newton-boosting-trees"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="btn btn-ghost"
      >
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            clip-rule="evenodd"
            d="M12 .5C5.65.5.5 5.65.5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.1.79-.25.79-.56 0-.28-.01-1.02-.01-2-3.2.69-3.88-1.54-3.88-1.54-.52-1.33-1.28-1.68-1.28-1.68-1.05-.71.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.24-1.28-5.24-5.7 0-1.26.45-2.29 1.18-3.09-.12-.29-.51-1.46.11-3.04 0 0 .97-.31 3.17 1.18.92-.26 1.91-.39 2.89-.39.98 0 1.97.13 2.89.39 2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.62 1.58.23 2.75.11 3.04.74.8 1.18 1.83 1.18 3.09 0 4.43-2.7 5.41-5.27 5.7.41.36.78 1.07.78 2.15 0 1.55-.01 2.8-.01 3.18 0 .31.21.67.8.55C20.21 21.39 23.5 17.08 23.5 12 23.5 5.65 18.35.5 12 .5Z"
          />
        </svg>
        View on GitHub
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero visual: loss curves -->
    <div class="reveal mt-16 md:mt-20" style="animation-delay: 280ms;">
      <LossCurve />
    </div>

    <!-- Trust strip -->
    <div class="reveal mt-16 md:mt-20" style="animation-delay: 360ms;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Reproducing &amp; extending</p>
      <div
        class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-y-6 gap-x-10 border-t border-line pt-6 sm:grid-cols-4"
      >
        <div>
          <div class="text-display-md font-display text-ink">139</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">Test cases covering identities &amp; edge cases</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-display-md font-display text-ink">4</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">Analytic losses with known M<sub>0</sub></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-display-md font-display text-ink">0</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">Runtime dependencies beyond NumPy</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-display-md font-display text-ink">6</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-[13px] text-ink-soft">Mathematical guarantees, byte-faithful</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
